{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>By this.</b> He showed him the betrothal document and the marriage contract, and Joseph sought mercy for the matter, and the holy spirit rested upon him." "<b>And he said: Bring them, I pray you, to me, and I will bless them.</b> This is what Scripture says: ״וְאָנֹכִי תִרְגַּלְתִּי לְאֶפְרַיִם קָחָם עַל זְרוֹעֹתָיו״ (Hosea 11) — I trained my spirit in Jacob for the sake of Ephraim, until he took them upon his arms."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:56.243609808Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}